--- !u!114 &822903814
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 822903811}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: dcdbb0b598fece24d9617cee6ae098e8, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  edit: 0
  note: " NOTE: AlarmEmitter Script\r\n\r\n This component simulates environmental
    alarm events (e.g., explosions, screams, alerts) \r\n that AI agents (Brains)
    can detect and react to. When triggered, it emits a signal \r\n that alerts nearby
    AI within a specified radius.\r\n\r\n HOW IT WORKS:\r\n \u2022 Optionally auto-triggers
    when the GameObject is enabled.  \r\n \u2022 Notifies all nearby Brains within
    the alarmRadius.  \r\n \u2022 Can either alert all AI groups or only specific
    ones defined in 'alarmGroups'.  \r\n \u2022 AI agents respond by executing their
    alarm reaction routine.\r\n\r\n USE CASES:\r\n - Alarms or sirens that make nearby
    enemies investigate.  \r\n - Environmental events like gunshots or explosions. 
    \r\n - Traps or scripted sequences to alert specific groups of NPCs."
